<title>JAPAN: Nippon Shoji - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Shoji - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		107.30		vs	  103.76</p>
<p> Operating	  946    million    vs	    1.17</p>
<p> Current		1.24		vs	    1.67</p>
<p> Net		  561    million    vs	  785    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.99 yen	  vs	   12.58 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     62 million	  vs	  62 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.00 yen	  vs	    7.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Shoji Kaisha Ltd is a leading pharmaceutical wholesaler.</p>
